{"title":"Career Roadmap · Industrial Relations Manager","role":"Industrial Relations Manager","summary":"An Industrial Relations (IR) Manager manages the relationship between an organization and its workforce, particularly in environments with significant employee relations, workforce-management and labour-law requirements.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law – LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Labour & Employment Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Industrial Relations (IR) Manager manages the relationship between an organization and its workforce, particularly in environments with significant employee relations, workforce-management and labour-law requirements."},{"type":"p","text":"The role is especially relevant in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Automotive"},{"text":"Steel"},{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Construction"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Mining"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Large service organizations"},{"text":"Public-sector enterprises"},{"text":"Organizations with recognized unions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An IR Manager may handle:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Labour-law compliance"},{"text":"Employee relations"},{"text":"Union relations"},{"text":"Collective bargaining"},{"text":"Grievance management"},{"text":"Disciplinary proceedings"},{"text":"Workplace investigations"},{"text":"Industrial disputes"},{"text":"Negotiations"},{"text":"Workforce policies"},{"text":"Employee engagement"},{"text":"Compliance audits"},{"text":"Labour inspections"},{"text":"Standing orders/service rules"},{"text":"HR documentation"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["The role combines law","HR","negotiation","workforce management","business operations."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","Integrated Law Degree"]},{"typ