plicable requirements may arise under central legislation/codes, state rules, sector-specific requirements and organizational policies."}]},{"heading":"Employee Grievance Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong IR professional needs a structured grievance process."},{"type":"flow","items":["Employee Complaint","Complaint Registration","Fact Collection","Document Review","Employee Discussion","Management Review","Resolution / Corrective Action","Communication","Follow-up"]},{"type":"p","text":"Common grievance areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Salary"},{"text":"Working hours"},{"text":"Leave"},{"text":"Supervisor behavior"},{"text":"Work allocation"},{"text":"Workplace conditions"},{"text":"Transfers"},{"text":"Discipline"},{"text":"Benefits"},{"text":"Workplace safety"}]}]},{"heading":"Union Relations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Industrial relations becomes particularly important where workers are represented by unions."},{"type":"p","text":"An IR Manager should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Union-Management Relationship"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Recognition"},{"text":"Meetings"},{"text":"Agreements"},{"text":"Dispute prevention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Listening"},{"text":"Neutral communication"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Conflict management"},{"text":"Relationship building"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"The objective is not simply to \"win\" negotiations, but to achieve legally compliant and commercially sustainable outcomes."}]}]},{"heading":"Collective Bargaining","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A typical process can be represented as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Prepare Workforce Data","Identify Employee / Business Priorities","Analyze Financial Position","Define Negotiation Objectives","Meet Employee Representatives","Exchange Proposals","Negotia