rmissible?"},{"type":"h","text":"HR Question"},{"type":"p","text":"Is the policy appropriate for employees?"},{"type":"h","text":"Business Question"},{"type":"p","text":"Is the solution operationally sustainable?"},{"type":"h","text":"IR Question"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How will employees and their representatives respond?"},{"text":"Strong IR professionals combine all four perspectives."}]}]},{"heading":"Projects During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Labour Compliance Audit"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a hypothetical compliance audit for a manufacturing unit."},{"type":"p","text":"Check:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Working hours"},{"text":"Wages"},{"text":"Leave"},{"text":"Safety"},{"text":"Employee records"},{"text":"Social security"},{"text":"Contract labour"},{"text":"Grievance systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Collective Bargaining Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct a mock negotiation between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Management vs Employee Union"},{"type":"p","text":"Topics:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wage increase"},{"text":"Working hours"},{"text":"Leave"},{"text":"Incentives"},{"text":"Productivity bonus"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Management position"},{"text":"Union position"},{"text":"Negotiation rounds"},{"text":"Final settlement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Grievance Management System"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a workflow for:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Complaint","Registration","Classification","Investigation","Resolution","Employee Communication","Closure"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Disciplinary Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a hypothetical misconduct case and prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Incident report"},{"text":"Show-cause notice"},{"text":"Employee response"},{"text":"Enquiry process"},{"text":"Findings"},{"text":"Final decision"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Workforce Analytics Dashboard"},{"t